[{"answer":"I have been thinking about what I'd like to be when I grow up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/1.mp3"},{"answer":"There are so many choices.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be a principal like my father.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be a teacher.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I like animals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe I should be a veterinarian.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/6.mp3"},{"answer":"My cat just went to the veterinarian to get her shots.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think my cat was too happy to be there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be a farmer and grow vegetables.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe I could be a doctor and cure people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/10.mp3"},{"answer":"If I was good enough, I could be a famous sports person or a singer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be an actor on television or in the movies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe I would like to be a policeman or a fireman.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I could rescue people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I can play the piano.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe I should be a musician.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be a lawyer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I sometimes watch shows about lawyers defending people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Lawyers have to be able to speak well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be a carpenter and work with wood,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/20.mp3"},{"answer":"or I could be a welder and work with metal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/21.mp3"},{"answer":"There are just so many jobs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I could work in a restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I could cook food, or I could serve food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be an airline pilot or the captain of a ship.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I could be a repairman or an artist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The world is full of jobs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the jobs require a lot of education.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Some require a little bit of training, and some require a lot of training.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It's all up to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I can be whatever I want to be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/93-when-i-grow-up-2019-04-07-03-50-36/31.mp3"}]
